
<html xmlns:o='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office' xmlns:w='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40'>
<head><title>Schemes List</title>
<style>
body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; }
h1 { color: #2C3E50; text-align: center; font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
h2 { color: #2980B9; border-bottom: 2px solid #BDC3C7; padding-bottom: 5px; margin-top: 20px; text-transform: capitalize; }
ul { margin-bottom: 20px; line-height: 1.6; }
li { margin-bottom: 8px; }
strong { color: #34495E; font-size: 14px; }
.desc { color: #555; font-size: 13px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>SchemesCheck - Complete List of Schemes</h1>
<p style="text-align: center;">This document contains all the government schemes currently integrated into the SchemesCheck platform database.</p>
<h2>Category: Farmers</h2><ul><li><strong>PM-Kisan Samman Nidhi</strong><br><span class="desc">Financial assistance to all landholding farmer families to take care of agricultural and domestic needs.</span></li><li><strong>Pradhan Mantri Fasal Bima Yojana (PMFBY)</strong><br><span class="desc">Crop insurance scheme for financial support against crop loss due to natural calamities.</span></li><li><strong>Kisan Credit Card (KCC)</strong><br><span class="desc">Providing adequate and timely credit support from the banking system.</span></li><li><strong>Soil Health Card Scheme</strong><br><span class="desc">Provides soil health reports and fertilizer recommendations.</span></li><li><strong>PM Krishi Sinchai Yojana (PMKSY)</strong><br><span class="desc">Improving water-use efficiency and expanding irrigation coverage.</span></li><li><strong>E-NAM (National Agriculture Market)</strong><br><span class="desc">Pan-India electronic trading portal for agricultural commodities.</span></li><li><strong>Paramparagat Krishi Vikas Yojana (PKVY)</strong><br><span class="desc">Promotion of organic farming and improving soil health.</span></li><li><strong>PM-KISAN Maandhan Yojana</strong><br><span class="desc">Pension scheme for small and marginal farmers.</span></li><li><strong>Agri-Infrastructure Fund</strong><br><span class="desc">Financing facility for post-harvest management infrastructure.</span></li><li><strong>PM Matsya Sampada Yojana</strong><br><span class="desc">Focused development of the fisheries sector.</span></li><li><strong>PM-AASHA</strong><br><span class="desc">Ensuring remunerative prices to farmers for their produce.</span></li><li><strong>National Food Security Mission</strong><br><span class="desc">Increasing production of rice, wheat, and pulses through area expansion.</span></li><li><strong>Micro Irrigation Fund</strong><br><span class="desc">Facilitating states in mobilizing resources for expanding micro-irrigation.</span></li><li><strong>Mission for Integrated Development of Horticulture</strong><br><span class="desc">Holistic growth of the horticulture sector.</span></li><li><strong>Kisan Urja Suraksha evam Utthaan Mahabhiyan (PM-KUSUM)</strong><br><span class="desc">Helping farmers install solar pumps and grid-connected solar plants.</span></li><li><strong>Raitha Vidyanidhi Scholarship</strong><br><span class="desc">Scholarship for children of farmers to pursue higher education.</span></li><li><strong>Krishi Bhagya</strong><br><span class="desc">Livelihood improvement of rainfed farmers.</span></li><li><strong>Pashu Bhagya</strong><br><span class="desc">Assistance for purchasing quality livestock.</span></li><li><strong>Milk Incentive Scheme</strong><br><span class="desc">Incentive for milk producers through co-operative societies.</span></li><li><strong>Ganga Kalyana Scheme</strong><br><span class="desc">Free borewells for small/marginal farmers from backward classes.</span></li><li><strong>Raitha Siri</strong><br><span class="desc">Encouraging millet cultivation among state farmers.</span></li><li><strong>Krushi Aranya Protsaha Yojane</strong><br><span class="desc">Assistance for planting seedlings on farm bunds.</span></li><li><strong>Surya Raitha</strong><br><span class="desc">Solar pumpsets for farmers with surplus power sales.</span></li><li><strong>Raitha Sanjeevini (Accident Insurance)</strong><br><span class="desc">Ex-gratia payment to farmers in case of accidental death during farm work.</span></li><li><strong>Krishi Yantra Dhare</strong><br><span class="desc">Custom hiring centers for farm machinery.</span></li><li><strong>Savayava Bhagya</strong><br><span class="desc">Promotion of organic farming through cluster development.</span></li><li><strong>Krishi Navodyama</strong><br><span class="desc">Promoting agri-startups and innovation in the state.</span></li><li><strong>Bhoo Chetana</strong><br><span class="desc">Soil health enhancement through nutrient management.</span></li><li><strong>Suvarna Gramodaya</strong><br><span class="desc">Holistic development of selected villages.</span></li><li><strong>Karnataka State Agriculture Marketing Board Loans</strong><br><span class="desc">Pledge loans against agricultural produce.</span></li></ul><h2>Category: Self Employed</h2><ul><li><strong>PM MUDRA Yojana (PMMY)</strong><br><span class="desc">Collateral-free loans up to ₹10 lakh to micro/small business entities.</span></li><li><strong>PMEGP (Prime Minister Employment Generation Programme)</strong><br><span class="desc">Credit-linked subsidy scheme for setting up new micro-enterprises.</span></li><li><strong>Stand-Up India Scheme</strong><br><span class="desc">Facilitating bank loans to SC/ST and women entrepreneurs for greenfield enterprises.</span></li><li><strong>PM Vishwakarma Scheme</strong><br><span class="desc">Comprehensive support for artisans and craftspeople.</span></li><li><strong>Credit Guarantee Fund Trust for Micro and Small Enterprises (CGTMSE)</strong><br><span class="desc">Guarantee cover for collateral-free credit facilities to MSEs.</span></li><li><strong>MSME Champion Scheme</strong><br><span class="desc">Integrated scheme for MSME development including digital and design support.</span></li><li><strong>SFURTI (Cluster Development)</strong><br><span class="desc">Organizing traditional industries and artisans into clusters.</span></li><li><strong>Startup India Seed Fund</strong><br><span class="desc">Financial assistance to startups for proof of concept and prototype development.</span></li><li><strong>PM Formalization of Micro Food Processing Enterprises (PMFME)</strong><br><span class="desc">Support for micro food processing units to formalize and upgrade.</span></li><li><strong>ASPIRE Scheme</strong><br><span class="desc">Promotion of innovation, rural industry, and entrepreneurship.</span></li><li><strong>ZED Certification Scheme</strong><br><span class="desc">Certification for MSMEs to adopt Zero Defect Zero Effect practices.</span></li><li><strong>NSIC Marketing Assistance</strong><br><span class="desc">Assisting MSMEs in marketing their products and services.</span></li><li><strong>CLCSS (Credit Linked Capital Subsidy Scheme)</strong><br><span class="desc">Facilitating technology upgradation by providing upfront capital subsidy.</span></li><li><strong>One District One Product (ODOP)</strong><br><span class="desc">Identifying and promoting a unique product from each district.</span></li><li><strong>Self Employment Lending (National Corporations)</strong><br><span class="desc">Term loans for SC/ST/OBC/Handicapped to start small businesses.</span></li><li><strong>Chief Minister’s Self Employment Generation Programme (CMEGP)</strong><br><span class="desc">Generating employment in rural and urban areas through micro-enterprises.</span></li><li><strong>Udyogini (Women Welfare)</strong><br><span class="desc">Assisting women to start micro-businesses with loan subsidies.</span></li><li><strong>KMDC Self-Employment Loan</strong><br><span class="desc">Economic individual development loan for minority community members.</span></li><li><strong>Dr. Ambedkar Development Corporation Self-Employment Scheme</strong><br><span class="desc">Direct lending and bank tied-up loans for SC entrepreneurs.</span></li><li><strong>Vishwakarma Communities Development Loan</strong><br><span class="desc">Support for traditional artisans from Vishwakarma communities.</span></li><li><strong>KSTDC Tourist Taxi Scheme</strong><br><span class="desc">Financial assistance for unemployed youth to purchase tourist taxis.</span></li><li><strong>Unnati Scheme (Social Startups)</strong><br><span class="desc">Supporting startups that address social issues through innovation.</span></li><li><strong>Badavara Bandhu (Mobile Bank)</strong><br><span class="desc">Interest-free loans for street vendors to escape money lenders.</span></li><li><strong>Devaraj Urs Backward Classes Development Direct Loan</strong><br><span class="desc">Self-employment loans for individuals from backward classes.</span></li><li><strong>Karnataka Handloom Development Corporation (KHDC) Support</strong><br><span class="desc">Assistance to handloom weavers for modernization and marketing.</span></li><li><strong>Cauvery Handicrafts (KSHDCL) Artisan Kits</strong><br><span class="desc">Modern toolkits and training for handicraft artisans.</span></li><li><strong>Elevate (Startup Karnataka)</strong><br><span class="desc">Flagship grant-in-aid scheme for startups across various sectors.</span></li><li><strong>Kayaka Scheme (SHG Support)</strong><br><span class="desc">Empowering women SHGs to start productive enterprises.</span></li><li><strong>Rural Artisan Direct Loan</strong><br><span class="desc">Financial assistance for rural artisans to start small workshops.</span></li><li><strong>Karnataka Leather Industries (LIDKAR) Support</strong><br><span class="desc">Assisting footwear and leather goods makers in the state.</span></li></ul><h2>Category: Students</h2><ul><li><strong>National Means-cum-Merit Scholarship (NMMSS)</strong><br><span class="desc">Scholarship for meritorious students of economically weaker sections to prevent dropouts at class 8.</span></li><li><strong>PM-USP (Scholarship for College Students)</strong><br><span class="desc">Financial assistance to meritorious students from low-income families for higher studies.</span></li><li><strong>PM-Vidyalaxmi</strong><br><span class="desc">Collateral-free and guarantor-free education loans for meritorious students in top institutions.</span></li><li><strong>Central Sector Interest Subsidy (CSIS)</strong><br><span class="desc">Interest subsidy on education loans for technical and professional courses.</span></li><li><strong>PM-YASASVI Scholarship</strong><br><span class="desc">Scholarship for students belonging to OBC, EBC, and DNT categories.</span></li><li><strong>National Apprenticeship Promotion Scheme (NAPS)</strong><br><span class="desc">Promoting apprenticeship training and increasing engagement of apprentices.</span></li><li><strong>Sukanya Samriddhi Yojana</strong><br><span class="desc">Savings scheme for the girl child to meet education and marriage expenses.</span></li><li><strong>PM CARES for Children</strong><br><span class="desc">Support for children who lost both parents to COVID-19.</span></li><li><strong>Pragati Scholarship for Girls</strong><br><span class="desc">Assisting girls to pursue technical education (Degree/Diploma).</span></li><li><strong>Saksham Scholarship</strong><br><span class="desc">Technical education support for specially-abled students.</span></li><li><strong>National Overseas Scholarship</strong><br><span class="desc">Support for students from SC and landless agricultural laborer families to study abroad.</span></li><li><strong>INSPIRE Scholarship</strong><br><span class="desc">Scholarship for top science students to pursue higher science education.</span></li><li><strong>Post-Matric Scholarship for Minorities</strong><br><span class="desc">Financial support for students from minority communities for studies beyond class 10.</span></li><li><strong>Kishore Vaigyanik Protsahan Yojana (KVPY)</strong><br><span class="desc">Fellowship program to encourage students to take up research in basic sciences.</span></li><li><strong>Junior Research Fellowship (NET-JRF)</strong><br><span class="desc">Financial assistance to candidates for pursuing research in various subjects.</span></li><li><strong>SSP Post-Matric Scholarship</strong><br><span class="desc">Comprehensive scholarship portal for SC/ST/OBC/Minority students.</span></li><li><strong>Vidyasiri (Food & Accommodation)</strong><br><span class="desc">Maintenance allowance for OBC/EBC students who don't get hostel seats.</span></li><li><strong>Arivu Education Loan Scheme</strong><br><span class="desc">Low-interest education loans for minority students pursuing professional courses.</span></li><li><strong>Prabuddha Overseas Scholarship</strong><br><span class="desc">Scholarship for SC/ST students to study in top global universities.</span></li><li><strong>Free Laptops for SC/ST Students</strong><br><span class="desc">Free laptop distribution for college students from SC/ST communities.</span></li><li><strong>Incentive for SSLC & 2nd PUC (Minority)</strong><br><span class="desc">Cash prize for high scorers in board exams from minority communities.</span></li><li><strong>PhD Fellowship (Social Welfare Board)</strong><br><span class="desc">Monthly fellowship for PhD students from backward classes.</span></li><li><strong>SSP Pre-Matric Scholarship</strong><br><span class="desc">Scholarship for students from class 1 to 10.</span></li><li><strong>Chief Minister’s Kaushalya Karnataka (CMKKY)</strong><br><span class="desc">Skill training for youth to improve employability.</span></li><li><strong>Kittur Rani Chennamma Award</strong><br><span class="desc">Incentive for girl students who excel in PU exams and belong to poor families.</span></li><li><strong>Samriddhi Scheme (SC/ST Startups)</strong><br><span class="desc">Support for SC/ST students to become entrepreneurs through franchise models.</span></li><li><strong>Free Cycle Scheme</strong><br><span class="desc">Distribution of free cycles to school students in rural areas.</span></li><li><strong>D. Devaraj Urs Foreign Education Scholarship</strong><br><span class="desc">Overseas scholarship for students from backward classes.</span></li><li><strong>Adarsha Vidyalaya Entrance Fellowship</strong><br><span class="desc">Special support for students admitted to Adarsha Vidyalayas (English Medium schools).</span></li><li><strong>Vidyasiri Rural Hostel maintenance</strong><br><span class="desc">Special maintenance for students in rural hosteling facilities.</span></li></ul><h2>Category: Unemployed</h2><ul><li><strong>Pradhan Mantri Kaushal Vikas Yojana (PMKVY)</strong><br><span class="desc">Offering short-term training and certification of prior learning for unemployed youth.</span></li><li><strong>Prime Minister’s Employment Generation Programme (PMEGP)</strong><br><span class="desc">Financial assistance to set up micro-enterprises in non-farm sectors.</span></li><li><strong>National Career Service (NCS) Portal</strong><br><span class="desc">ICT-based portal that provides a wide range of employment-related services.</span></li><li><strong>ASEEM (Aatmanirbhar Skilled Employee Employer Mapping)</strong><br><span class="desc">AI-based platform to match skilled people with available jobs.</span></li><li><strong>DDU-GKY (Deen Dayal Upadhyaya Grameen Kaushalya Yojana)</strong><br><span class="desc">Skill training and placement program exclusively for rural youth.</span></li><li><strong>PM-DAKSH Yojana</strong><br><span class="desc">Skill development for Scheduled Castes, Backward Classes, and Safai Karamcharis.</span></li><li><strong>STRIVE (Skills Strengthening for Industrial Value Enhancement)</strong><br><span class="desc">Improving the relevance and efficiency of ITIs in India.</span></li><li><strong>SANKALP Scheme</strong><br><span class="desc">Strengthening institutional mechanisms for skill development at district and state levels.</span></li><li><strong>National Apprenticeship Promotion Scheme (NAPS)</strong><br><span class="desc">Promoting apprenticeship training and increasing engagement of apprentices.</span></li><li><strong>Jan Shikshan Sansthan (JSS)</strong><br><span class="desc">Vocational training for non-literates, neo-literates, and school dropouts in rural/urban slums.</span></li><li><strong>PM Kaushal Kendra (PMKK)</strong><br><span class="desc">State-of-the-art Model Training Centres (MTCs) in every district.</span></li><li><strong>National SC-ST Hub (NSSH)</strong><br><span class="desc">Building an ecosystem to support SC/ST entrepreneurs.</span></li><li><strong>SAMRATH (Textile Skill Development)</strong><br><span class="desc">Skill development program in the textile sector.</span></li><li><strong>Self-Employment Lending (OBC/EBC)</strong><br><span class="desc">Credit for starting small businesses for Backward Classes.</span></li><li><strong>Credit Guarantee for Micro Units (CGFMU)</strong><br><span class="desc">Guarantee for loans extended under MUDRAn Yojana.</span></li><li><strong>Yuva Nidhi Scheme</strong><br><span class="desc">Monthly allowance for unemployed graduates and diploma holders of the state.</span></li><li><strong>Chief Minister’s Kaushalya Karnataka (CMKKY)</strong><br><span class="desc">Flagship vocational training scheme of Karnataka Govt.</span></li><li><strong>CMEGP (Self-Employment Generation)</strong><br><span class="desc">Loan-cum-subsidy for unemployed youth to start small industries.</span></li><li><strong>Dr. Ambedkar Swavalambana Yojana</strong><br><span class="desc">Individual self-employment loans for SC community members.</span></li><li><strong>Samriddhi (Franchise-based Entrepreneurship)</strong><br><span class="desc">Supporting SC/ST youth to become business owners via franchises.</span></li><li><strong>KSTDC Tourist Taxi Scheme</strong><br><span class="desc">Empowering unemployed youth by helping them buy tourist taxis.</span></li><li><strong>Devaraj Urs Development Corporation Startup Loan</strong><br><span class="desc">Start-up capital for Backward Classes (OBC) youth.</span></li><li><strong>Kayaka (SHG Enterprise Support)</strong><br><span class="desc">Supporting SHG members to migrate from wage labor to small units.</span></li><li><strong>Badavara Bandhu (Zero Interest Loan for Start)</strong><br><span class="desc">Small interest-free capital for starting micro-vending trades.</span></li><li><strong>Minority Development Corporation Self-Employment Scheme</strong><br><span class="desc">Loan and subsidy for minority youth for diverse businesses.</span></li><li><strong>Ambedkar Self Employment for Physically Challenged</strong><br><span class="desc">Tailored loans for differently-abled individuals to start shops.</span></li><li><strong>Elevate (Startup Grants for Women/Tier-2)</strong><br><span class="desc">Grants for startups from small towns or women-led teams.</span></li><li><strong>Unnati (Social Innovation Grants)</strong><br><span class="desc">Matching grant-in-aid for SC/ST innovators/entrepreneurs.</span></li><li><strong>Suvarna Kayaka</strong><br><span class="desc">One-time technical training for youth in rural areas.</span></li><li><strong>Madiwala Development Corporation Loan</strong><br><span class="desc">Financial assistance for washing, ironing, and drying trades.</span></li></ul><h2>Category: Workers</h2><ul><li><strong>MGNREGA</strong><br><span class="desc">Providing 100 days of guaranteed wage employment to rural households.</span></li><li><strong>PM Shram Yogi Maan-Dhan (PM-SYM)</strong><br><span class="desc">Pension scheme for unorganized sector workers like rickshaw pullers and domestic workers.</span></li><li><strong>Ayushman Bharat-PMJAY</strong><br><span class="desc">Health insurance for vulnerable and low-income families.</span></li><li><strong>PM Jeevan Jyoti Bima Yojana (PMJJBY)</strong><br><span class="desc">Low-cost life insurance scheme for bank account holders.</span></li><li><strong>PM Suraksha Bima Yojana (PMSBY)</strong><br><span class="desc">Accident insurance scheme with a very low annual premium.</span></li><li><strong>PM Awas Yojana - Gramin (PMAY-G)</strong><br><span class="desc">Providing affordable housing to rural poor.</span></li><li><strong>PM SVANidhi</strong><br><span class="desc">Collateral-free micro-credit for street vendors.</span></li><li><strong>DDU-GKY (Skill Training)</strong><br><span class="desc">Placement-linked skill training program for rural youth.</span></li><li><strong>Atal Pension Yojana (APY)</strong><br><span class="desc">Pension scheme for all citizens, especially in the unorganized sector.</span></li><li><strong>PM Ujjwala Yojana</strong><br><span class="desc">Providing clean cooking fuel (LPG) to women from BPL families.</span></li><li><strong>National Food Security Act (NFSA)</strong><br><span class="desc">Ensuring access to essential food grains at highly subsidized prices.</span></li><li><strong>PM Garib Kalyan Anna Yojana</strong><br><span class="desc">Free food grains to NFSA beneficiaries to mitigate economic hardship.</span></li><li><strong>Deendayal Antyodaya Yojana (NULM)</strong><br><span class="desc">Urban livelihoods mission to reduce poverty of urban poor households.</span></li><li><strong>National Social Assistance Programme</strong><br><span class="desc">Pensions for elderly, widows, and persons with disabilities.</span></li><li><strong>PM-eBus Sewa</strong><br><span class="desc">Augmenting city bus operations with focused on e-buses.</span></li><li><strong>Gig Workers Social Security Act</strong><br><span class="desc">First-of-its kind law to provide social security to platform-based workers like Swiggy/Zomato/Dunzo.</span></li><li><strong>BOCW Pension Scheme</strong><br><span class="desc">Pension for registered construction workers.</span></li><li><strong>Accident Compensation (BOCW)</strong><br><span class="desc">Immediate financial relief to construction workers in case of onsite accidents.</span></li><li><strong>Educational Assistance for Workers' Children</strong><br><span class="desc">Financial help for education of children of registered construction workers.</span></li><li><strong>Maternity Benefits for Registered Workers</strong><br><span class="desc">Cash support for female workers registered with the labor board during pregnancy.</span></li><li><strong>Marriage Assistance for Workers</strong><br><span class="desc">Grant for the marriage of registered workers or their children.</span></li><li><strong>Ambedkar Labour Assistance</strong><br><span class="desc">Distribution of free toolkits to laborers like barbers, masons, and cobblers.</span></li><li><strong>Thayi Bhagya</strong><br><span class="desc">Ensuring safe institutional deliveries for poor families.</span></li><li><strong>Udyogini Scheme</strong><br><span class="desc">Subsidy in loans for women to start micro-businesses.</span></li><li><strong>Kayaka Scheme</strong><br><span class="desc">Zero percent interest loans for Self Help Groups (SHGs).</span></li><li><strong>Badavara Bandhu</strong><br><span class="desc">Interest-free mobile bank for street vendors.</span></li><li><strong>Charmashilpa Scheme</strong><br><span class="desc">Support for leather artisans to modernize their produce.</span></li><li><strong>Madilu Kit</strong><br><span class="desc">Essential kit for new mothers and babies from labor families.</span></li><li><strong>Bus Pass for Building Workers</strong><br><span class="desc">Free bus passes for construction workers for city commuting.</span></li><li><strong>Karnataka Labour Welfare Board Educational Assistance</strong><br><span class="desc">Scholarship for children of workers in industries and factories.</span></li></ul></body></html>